#N Buckaroo
#O Dave Buckingham (named by Bill Gosper)
#C A queen bee shuttle stabilised by an eater so that its spark turns a
#C passing glider; shown with the glider on its way in.
#C Verified by the Emergence Lab verifier (B3/S23, unbounded grid): reflects
#C incoming glider moving (1, 1) into direction (1, -1) and is restored.
